        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Spare batteries, for smartphone, at plant
The data set represents the production of smartphone spare Li-ion battery; UUID: 5de913af-2d60-3d43-a0bc-df45ce0ae83d
The dataset for smartphone spare screen comprises the rechargeable lithium ion battery, adjusted to the mass of average smartphones, ie 160 grams.
Location: Data for global average battery for smartphone
Technology: Typical rechargeable Li-ion battery for portable devices
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5de913af-2d60-3d43-a0bc-df45ce0ae83d.xml</text>
